1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:04,990
You can pop parts of ActTrader out into their own windows.

2
00:00:05,090 --> 00:00:10,060
New chart opens a chart in a window of its own.

3
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:14,090
Drag the title bar to move it anywhere, even onto another screen.

4
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:17,640
The green button makes it full size.

5
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:22,030
The red button closes it.

6
00:00:22,130 --> 00:00:26,010
Right click a tab along the top to undock it.

7
00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:31,370
Summary now has its own window, so you can keep it open while you trade.

8
00:00:31,470 --> 00:00:35,190
Click the red button to put it back in the main window.

9
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:38,190
It is back in its tab, right where it started.

